 in USD thousands based on<BR>
 average/spot exchange rate of the period)</TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">Difference for the year ended<BR>
