    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center">Difference for the nine months ended<BR>
 (as at) March&nbsp;31, 2023</TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
